# Descript

> Descript is an AI-powered video and audio editor that makes creating professional-quality content as easy as editing a document. Edit video by editing text, with 20+ AI tools for recording, editing, and publishing.

Descript is a collaborative audio and video editor used by marketing teams, podcasters, creators, and businesses. The platform combines text-based video editing with AI tools for transcription, screen recording, captioning, clip generation, and publishing. Descript's AI co-editor, Underlord, can handle editing tasks from rough cuts to final polish.

## Core Product

- [AI Video Editor (Underlord)](https://www.descript.com/underlord): AI-powered co-editor that handles video editing tasks including rough cuts, removing filler words, and generating polished edits.
- [Text-Based Video Editing](https://www.descript.com/video-editing): Edit video by editing the automatically transcribed text — delete a word from the transcript and it's cut from the video.
- [Transcription](https://www.descript.com/transcription): Fast, accurate AI transcription for audio and video in 23+ languages.
- [Screen Recording](https://www.descript.com/screen-recorder): Record screen and camera for tutorials, demos, and presentations with built-in editing.
- [Podcasting](https://www.descript.com/podcasting): Record, edit, and produce audio and video podcasts with multitrack editing and AI tools.
- [Rooms](https://www.descript.com/rooms): 4K remote recording for podcasts and video interviews with guests.

## AI Features

- [Captions](https://www.descript.com/captions): Add captions and subtitles to videos automatically in one click.
- [Clips](https://www.descript.com/clips): Generate short clips from long-form video using AI.
- [AI Video Generation](https://www.descript.com/ai-video): Generate and edit video with AI-powered tools.
- [AI Avatars](https://www.descript.com/ai-avatars): Create talking AI avatars for video without being on camera.
- [Brand Studio](https://www.descript.com/brand-studio): Apply brand templates, logos, and assets to every video automatically.
- [Eye Contact](https://www.descript.com/eye-contact): AI effect that corrects eye contact in video recordings.
- [Studio Sound](https://www.descript.com/studio-sound): Remove background noise and echo from audio with one click.

